==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈl̥aiːja/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|aiːja|lang=is}}
*: Homophones: {{l|is|hlægja}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|hlæja|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|hlahjanan|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|hló|hlógu|hlegið}}

# {{intransitive|lang=is}} to [[laugh]]
#: ''Að '''hlæja''' dátt.''
#:: To '''laugh''' heartily.
 
====Derived terms====
* [[hlæja hátt]] (to laugh [[loud]])
* [[hlæja að]]
* [[hlæja hugur við]] (to gladden one's heart)
*: ''Þau tíðindi, er þeim '''hló hugur við'''.''
*:: The tidings, that '''gladdened''' their '''hearts.
* [[skellihlæja]]

====Related terms====
* [[hlátur]]

